WEBVTT

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.970
It was an era when a man lived as a warrior...

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:10.780
He fought, staking his life on
his faith in the sword...

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.610
The final era... the Bakumatsu.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:29.000
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.850
Tsukikage kooru daichi wo

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.690
Korogari fumiwakete yuku

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:57.900
Horobi to saisei no jidai ga hajimaru

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.570
Jiyuu wo omoku kakagete

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:05.170
Michinaki michi wo erande

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:12.240
Mahiru yori mabushii nichibotsu wo koete

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:19.250
Yume wo kataru you ni toki no fune wa yuku

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:28.350
Sono yamiji no mukou ni atarashii yoake

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:36.270
Bokura wa kitto kurayami no kaina kara umarete kita

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.810
Kanawanu koi wo suruyou ni

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:43.780
Hikari e to samayotteku

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:49.050
Doko made mo hateshino nai kono michi wo

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:54.490
Kaeru sube wa nai

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:40.100
"The Mysterious Tale of the Ghost-Sealing
Moontear Assassin".

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:42.300
This is the first night.
And it's about to begin.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:52.340
We hope each one of you enjoy the show
from the beginning all the way to the very end.

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:59.010
Thank you very much!

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:12.990
About 2004 years ago, there was a man who was
beheaded for opposing Emperor Shi Huangdi.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:22.930
Whether my life is ended, or my head is severed,
I promise that I will return as a vengeful ghost!

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:29.240
So his vengeful spirit lingered on.

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:38.720
The people were terrified and soon began
to call it The Head of the Conqueror!

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:59.410
The Hermit Jofuku became extremely
concerned about the troubled people.

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:04.440
He forged an enchanted blade that would
seal the Head of the Conqueror,

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:07.740
he entrusted it to a certain man.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.240
Miss Oryo is in Yokohama?

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:34.230
Yes.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:40.110
Leader, I want you to tell Yo-san
something for me.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:44.490
His words... The words of Ryoma Sakamoto.

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:01.040
Yes?

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:05.000
I'm from Totsukawa. Is Sakamoto-sensei here?

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:08.770
Master, you've got a visitor from Totsukawa!

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:19.350
Shinta!

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:56.860
Ryo... ma...

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:08.840
Shinta...

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:33.960
It's gotten to my brain... This is not good...

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:49.370
Police

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:49.370
Police

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:49.370
Police

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.370
Police

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.370
Police

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.370
Police

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:49.370
Police

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:49.370
Police

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.640
I believed him.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:58.550
There was no way Yo would kill him...
That's just impossible.

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:02.860
I believed him no matter what.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:15.700
After a long and harsh interrogation,
he was released.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:20.570
But he just disappeared
without saying anything to anyone.

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:26.080
He must've blamed himself
for not being able to protect him.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:28.410
I waited for him for a long time...

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.820
I just had to tell him...

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:35.660
His words... Ryo's words!

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:42.930
Ryo told me about it once...

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.530
About the Head.

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:49.370
I've been enjoying it for a long time.

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:54.070
The Head has been wandering around me,
looking for a chance to possess me.

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:57.370
But look at what kind of era we live in.

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:02.710
Yojiro might end up getting killed
because he's my bodyguard.

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:05.880
That's the last thing I want for him.

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:08.930
That's what I figured, so...

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:17.020
Don't tell me he placed the Head
far away from me on his own!

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:21.730
Sakamoto may have been
capable of doing that, but...

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:24.700
But, for that reason!

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:25.970
No!

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:30.510
Yo isn't responsible for what happened to him.

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:35.110
Yo should follow the path he chooses.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:42.350
I'm sure that's what he... what Ryoma Sakamoto
would want for him, too.

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:28.670
Good job, my child!

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:33.870
Now, off to Japan!

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:38.070
Off to the Land of the Rising Sun
to seal the Head!

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:45.290
And now the Head of the Conqueror is
resurrected and in the hands of one man!

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:14.450
To tell you the truth,
I'd love to go with Enomoto.

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:19.790
Go to Mito with him...
To where the former shogun is...

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:25.320
I feel pathetic... I feel pathetic
for not being able to do anything.

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:39.840
I understand how you feel,

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:44.800
but I can't help feeling that everyone
is just rushing to their deaths.

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:49.980
I hope this country is worth that much though...

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:53.290
Be careful.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:55.990
Be careful, Mister Katsu.

00:10:55.990 --> 00:11:00.760
If Brunet hears such
discouraging words from you...

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.300
You've got a good point.

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:05.600
England and France...

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:09.940
They're nothing but a fox and a tanuki
who are after this country...

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.430
Pardon?

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:14.340
Come on, let's have a drink!

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:18.180
Hey, bring sake! More sake!

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:49.670
Jules Brunet

00:11:53.680 --> 00:12:00.650
Oh, that must be the one who's with Nakaiya.
You know, his bodyguard.

00:12:01.090 --> 00:12:05.930
Don't you ever trust civilians,
especially not merchants!

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:12.070
Excuse me, but if we're not departing yet.
I'll go run some errands onshore.

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:21.580
And not writers, either!
Just like Dumas père and Balzac,

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:27.750
they're nothing but liberal bastards
who are lustful, overeating and wasteful!

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:29.880
I'll keep that in mind.

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.100
How is it going?

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.760
Where's the Head now?

00:12:57.110 --> 00:13:00.740
That was quite a performance indeed.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:04.490
The Head of the Conqueror
and The Eternal Assassin, huh?

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:08.360
It's really hard to believe it's fiction.

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:15.160
What's really scary may be the one
who actually wrote the script.

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:24.100
Can I please have some more, Master?

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:29.740
Oh my, I'm sorry about that. My fault.

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:36.650
Oh well, either way, I'm looking forward
to the rest of the story.

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:40.420
I wonder how the story ends.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.050
Excuse me.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:53.700
What? Tomorrow?

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:05.270
At this point, the most of the information
which had been delivered to Enomoto,

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:10.120
indicated the disadvantageous situation
the forces of the former Shogun were facing.

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:15.120
Nagaoka Castle, once retaken,
had fallen once again.

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:19.690
Tsuginosuke Kawai, badly injured,
had fled to Aizu.

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:22.770
Further, Shibata Province
had already vowed allegiance

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:26.460
and Yonezawa Province
was on the verge of surrendering.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:29.640
And Kamajiro is still going, huh?

00:14:34.050 --> 00:14:37.680
Takanawa Reception Area

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:37.550
Find it before we set sail!

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:47.190
If we have that, we won't need to tag along
with France and go to the far north.

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:53.190
That's why I moved you from
Mister Katsu to Nakaiya.

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:03.400
You do know that, don't you?

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.050
I like the sea!

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:27.730
There's a world beyond the sea!

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:32.860
So you came here to kill me?

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:35.500
You've got the same eyes.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:38.940
It's the same eyes I had when
I went to kill Katsu-sensei before!

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:43.740
What do you think? Why don't you
become my bodyguard, Akizuki?

00:15:52.820 --> 00:16:02.060
Hitotsu, higure ni gan kakete
One, make a wish on a sunset

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:12.530
Futatsu, fudasho no tsukimiso
Two, the primrose at the temple

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:23.080
Mittsu, misora ga akeru koro
Three, around the time when the beautiful sky opens up

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:33.590
Yottsu, yonaki no ko wo oute
Four, holding a child who cries the night away

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:43.410
Itsutsu, itsumade tsukeba yoi
Five, around when should I get there?

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:57.350
Akizuki-sama!

00:16:58.520 --> 00:16:59.720
Leader.

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:01.290
The practice is about to begin.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.280
Practice, practice!

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:37.390
Where is it?

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.600
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:42.570
Don't play dumb! Where did you hide the Head?

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:48.130
Did Nakaiya send you? Or Mister Parkes?

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:52.480
Sakyonosuke Kanna,

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:59.680
I've figured that you're a spy working for
Queen Victoria of Great Britain.

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:02.020
Who are you?

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:05.490
Don't move! Or I'll shoot!

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:33.280
Where's the Head?

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:37.850
Here it comes.

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:42.960
Akizuki?!

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:44.830
Where's the Head?

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:54.770
This is an unexpected scene for you three.
Why don't you two settle the score first?

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:57.930
Akizuki! I'll never let you have it!

00:18:58.140 --> 00:18:59.870
Don't let him fool you!

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:08.120
The Head has already...

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.280
...possessed him?!

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:24.200
82, 83, 84, 85,

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:24.240
86, 87, 88, 89, 90.

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:28.670
I wish we could start the rehearsal,
86, 87, 88, 89, 90.

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:30.840
but we still haven't received the script
for the second show from the master, right?
86, 87, 88, 89, 90.

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:33.940
Yeah, but I know it will get here.
86, 87, 88, 89, 90.

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:37.980
We've never been wrong for believing in him.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:39.650
That's true.

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:43.090
Although I still don't understand
what he's thinking...

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:51.390
Where's Leader?

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:56.130
Oh?

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:58.430
I don't see her.

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:02.130
That's strange. She came back here with us.

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:18.810
Wh-what...

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:25.260
Is there anything I can use?

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:31.400
Finally...

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:37.730
Why you!

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.170
Are you all right?

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:47.140
Akizuki-sama!

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.010
Master...

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:10.640
Now I know what role each of you play.

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:13.510
Why don't I write some more and...

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.110
Master...

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:19.680
He wasn't possessed by the Head.

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:21.920
So why would he do something like that?

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:42.610
