00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:47.600
EPISODE 13
THE HEAD OF
THE CONQUEROR
WITH A SOUL

00:23:33.820 --> 00:23:35.720
I knew it.

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:39.360
Akizuki is the one who plays
the Eternal Assassin.

00:23:39.420 --> 00:23:41.930
Nakaiya is played by Nakaiya himself.

00:23:42.060 --> 00:23:45.430
The Eternal Assassin
is played by the man himself.

00:23:45.430 --> 00:23:48.430
And whoever is here plays his or her own role.

00:23:47.600 --> 00:24:02.570
THE HEAD OF
THE CONQUEROR
WITH A SOUL

00:23:48.430 --> 00:23:51.600
That sounds like something the master
would come up with...

00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:55.770
What I've feared the most...
Lord Akizuki and Master are...

00:23:55.810 --> 00:24:00.980
Either way, it sounds like this play ends today.
